  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Communication and Visibility of the EU and Tanzania Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;To support the EU Delegation in Tanzania in development and implementation of communication and visibility activities in order to strengthen/increase the impact of the EU- TZ cooperation through; &#xbf; 1. Finalize and implement the EU Delegation&apos;s communication strategy &#xbf; 2. Promote the EU - Tanzania Partnership at national level &#xbf; 3. Organize communication campaigns on Gender and Youth; Climate Change; Transparency and Accountability &#xbf; 4. Promote the Africa-Europe Alliance as regards Tanzania, at national, regional and global level&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
